  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</a></span> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the Answer Key for the <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Posts</span> Post on the official website of RRB. This recruitment was released for 3058 posts. Applications for the RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 30 December 2025, to 29 January 2026. The examination was conducted on 14-15 July 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB JE Advt No. : CEN 08/2025&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Short Notice Date : <strong>17 December 225</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Starting Date :&nbsp;<strong>30 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply :<strong> 29 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Fee Payment :<strong> 31 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Form Correction / Modified Date :<strong> <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">01 – 10 February 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Status : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>14-15 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details :<strong> 04 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>10 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>31 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 500/-</span></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 250/-</span></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong> <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 250/-</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000;\"><strong>Fee Refund (After Appearing in Stage I Exam)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS, : <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 400/-</span></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 250/-</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong> <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 250/-</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">18 Years</span></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">30-40 Years (Post Wise)</span></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Posts : 312 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">149</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">24</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">76</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">40</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">23</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Check</strong>&nbsp;<strong>RRB Zone Wise Vacancy Details –&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Final_CEN_08_2025_Isolated_Categories_29_12_2025_Publish_English-639026356719777631-31-37.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Form 2026 : Post Wise Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chief Law Assistant </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">22 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Public Prosecutor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Translator(Hindi) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">202 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Senior Publicity Inspector</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">15</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Staff and Welfare Inspector </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">24 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant (Training) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lab Assistant Gr.III (Chemist &amp; Metallurgist)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">39 </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Supervisor/Ergonomics and</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Training</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Translator (Hindi)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Master’s degree in&nbsp;<strong>Hindi or English, with Hindi and English</strong>&nbsp;as compulsory subjects at the undergraduate level.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Staff and Welfare Inspector</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Bachelor’s degree along with a&nbsp;<strong>Diploma or LLB specializing in Labor Laws.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chief Law Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A law degree from a recognized&nbsp;<strong>university with a minimum of 3 years</strong>&nbsp;of standing practice as a pleader at the bar.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lab Asst. Grade III (Chemist &amp; Metalurgist)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Completed&nbsp;<strong>10+2 (Intermediate) with Science subjects (Physics and Chemistry)</strong>&nbsp;and holds a Diploma or Certificate in Laboratory Technology.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Senior Publicity Inspector</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Degree or&nbsp;<strong>Diploma in Public Relations, Advertising, Journalism, or Mass Communication, along with 2 years</strong>&nbsp;of relevant experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Publicity Prosecutor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Degree or Diploma in&nbsp;<strong>Public Relations, Advertising, Journalism, or Mass Communication.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant/ Training</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must possess a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"87\">Master’s degree in Psychology</strong>&nbsp;along with&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"134\">one year of relevant experience</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.6733%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Supervisor/Ergonomics and Training<br>\n</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.3267%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Second Class Masters Degree in Psychology or Physiology.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Two years experience in Administration of Psychological Tests of Mental</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">abilities and Personality. OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Two years research in Work Psychology. OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Two years experience in Developing Training Module or Conducting Training Programme. </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Desirable: Specialization in Industrial Psychology, Ergonomics / Counseling with knowledge of Statistics and Computers</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Skill Test / Typing Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check RRB Ministerial &amp; Isolated Category Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the Answer Key link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the Answer Key from the official website of RRB also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Answer Key</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://rrb.digialm.co